// Ch4 C4-03, the feast tables: Neme (the one table the wall's call waits for: the chapter flow sets
// ch04_feast_neme). She is clearing plates that are still full, humming while she works: the Velamir
// lullaby, the first verse's tune, the way the women of her line do (bible §6). If
// ch03_rhen_named_lullaby, Rhen knows it, and the camera holds on his face for a beat: a @face beat
// only, no line, and nobody explains it. Otherwise it's just a tune.
// Watch (ADR 0022): no line here, or anywhere in Act I, connects the tune to Dace or the lantern.
// H12 is the table; the hold is on Rhen.
title: ch04_wake_neme
location: ch04/haluna_wake
---
@anim neme clear_plates
@sfx neme_humming at=neme
Neme [neutral]: Nobody's eating. Eat, the pair of you. There's yam enough for the islet. #line:ch04_wake_neme_001
Asha [soft_smile]: We'll take some to the wall, Neme. #line:ch04_wake_neme_002
<<if $ch03_rhen_named_lullaby>>
@camera H12
@face rhen tender 0.4
@wait 2.0
@face rhen neutral 0.4
@camera release
<<endif>>
===
